# Conformance probe pack for a `length` value under `bit_order msb-lsb` (spec
# 0.22, ruling 2). Public. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the high bit of
# each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up. No kinds.
#
#   8 bits        the length of the block in bytes
#     x           8 bits
format     conformance-long-mlsb-length
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb-lsb
length  8
  field  probe.x  8  uint
end
